lines:
Your Pokémon may be infected with
Pokérus.{be01}
Little is known about the Pokérus
except that they are microscopic life-{be00}
forms that attach to Pokémon.{be01}
While infected, Pokémon are said to
grow exceptionally well.

Hey, you’ve got a PokéNav!
It’s the same as mine.{be01}
Check out the Trainer’s Eyes on it.{be01}
It shows you Trainers who want a
rematch with you.{be01}
Isn’t it great?
You have to hand it to Devon!
